  "$comment": "Models and their standard (not batch, not priority) API prices in USD per million tokens, read from each provider's own pages on `verified`. `cacheWrite` is the 5-minute cache write; null means the provider charges no write premium (new tokens cost the input price). `above` applies to a request whose prompt is longer than `promptTokens`. `effort` is sent with every request: Anthropic output_config.effort, OpenAI reasoning.effort, Gemini thinkingLevel. `profile` picks the v1 usage profile the cost estimate starts from (usage-model.json). Re-check prices before a paid run: `run` refuses to start when `verified` is more than 30 days old, and Gemini 3.8 Flash's introductory price ends on `validUntil`.",
